<title>USA: USA-STOCKS-OPEN.</title>
<headline>USA-STOCKS-OPEN.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Wall Street stocks were mixed in early trading on Thursday with investors looking to producer prices and retail sales data out tomorrow.</p>
<p>The Dow industrials were up 11.33 at 6575.17 and the Nasdaq composite was off 1.93 at 1247.50.</p>
<p>Decliners lead advancers eight to six on the New York Stock Exchange.</p>
</text>
